          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mkalisakasya pakutenda yindu yeleyi, pakuŵa mitundu jine ja ŵandu jingujitoposya jemanja mli mkwisa, jalisakesye pakutenda yakusakala yamti myiyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yitendo yawo yacisakesye cilambo, myoyo AMBUJE akucipa cilango cilamboco, pakwatoposya ŵanduwo kuti jemanja mkajinjile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵanduwo ŵayitesile yindu yakunyalaya yosopeyi, ni cilambo cosopeco caliji cesakale, nambo jemanja mkatenda cindu cilicose ca yakunyalayayi. Aisalaeli wosope mpaka acalendo ŵamkutama nawo, mkwenela kugakuya malamusi gangu ni kutenda yindu yosope yingumlamula kutenda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.26+LEV.18.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.26",
              "LEV.18.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mkatenda yindu yeleyi ni mkaŵa cilambo kumkana, mpela mucakanile ŵandu ŵa mitundu jine,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ŵiŵatemi mcilambo celeci jemanja mkanimyice. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pakuŵa mkumanyilila kuti jwalijose jwakutenda yindu yakunyalaya ya mtundu welewo, tacimtyosya mwikuga lya ŵandu acimjakwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
